# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Kubuno — fichiers NON versionnés (artefacts de build, données, secrets)
# Seul le CODE SOURCE est committé. Régénérables = exclus.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Rust — artefacts de compilation
/target/
**/target/

# Node — dépendances
node_modules/
**/node_modules/

# Web host — build outputs (web/; frontend/ before the move)
/web/dist/
/web/dist-gallery/
/web/dist-modules/
/web/dist-types/
/frontend/

# Paquets Debian générés
/dist/
*.deb

# build_deb.sh — état local
/.build_state
/.build_number

# Données d'exécution & logs
/data/
nohup.out
*.log

# Secrets & config locale (on garde uniquement les .example)
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
/config.toml
/server/config.toml
!config.toml.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.keystore

# Local editor state
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp

# Deliberately VERSIONED: server/Cargo.lock and common/Cargo.lock, server/.sqlx/ (the sqlx query cache,
# needed to build without a database in CI), server/migrations/, web/themes/, server/man/

# symlink local éventuel
node_modules

# Binaires téléchargés au build (ex. WinSW pour le service Windows)
_cache/


# Visual Studio tooling — per-machine artefacts (the .slnx / .slnLaunch / .rsproj /
# .esproj / NuGet.Config files ARE versioned)
obj/
.vs/
*.user
*.suo
# Local NuGet feed of the Kubuno SDK packages (binary, regenerated by the tooling)
.kubuno/sdk-feed/

# Co-located npm packages (web/src/<id>, e.g. @kubuno/sdk): the generated type tree and the packed
# tarball are regenerated by web/packages/build.sh and published by _tools/publish_all.sh; never committed.
# (obj/ above already covers the Visual Studio build's obj\package.)
/web/src/sdk/types/
/web/src/sdk/*.tgz

# .kbview web views: generated declarations and check files (never committed, WEB-VIEWS.md §2.1),
# the cargo target of the compiler's WASM build, and the compiler package's tsc state.
.kubuno/views/
**/.kubuno/views/
# The running dev server's announcement for the Visual Studio web designer (written while `vite serve` listens).
**/.kubuno/design-server.json
/web/packages/views-compiler/wasm/target/
/web/packages/views-compiler/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo

# TypeScript incremental build state (per machine; tracked copies made every build "dirty")
*.tsbuildinfo
